=> Node REFUSES to strip types for any file whose resolved path is under node_modules, in BOTH shapes.
   A shipped bundle installs at <profile>/node_modules/@mpd-dsh/mpd, so any .ts the USER's machine must
   execute with node FROM THE INSTALLED PACKAGE fails there; the same file runs fine from a checkout.
